# The build writes LF and the blobs in this repository are LF, but git checks
# text files out as CRLF on Windows when core.autocrlf is on. That combination
# leaves README.md permanently "modified" with an empty diff after every
# `npm run build`. Pinning the working tree to LF removes the mismatch.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
